   </row>
   <row>
    <id><![CDATA[116932]]></id>
    <qid><![CDATA[112060]]></qid>
    <question><![CDATA[I know how to apply for a job using a digital platform (e.g. fill in a form, upload my CV and photo). ]]></question>
