   </row>
   <row>
    <id><![CDATA[116933]]></id>
    <qid><![CDATA[112061]]></qid>
    <question><![CDATA[I know that many public services are available on the Internet (e.g. booking a health visit, submitting tax declaration, requesting birth, marriage, residence and other certificates). ]]></question>
