   <row>
    <id><![CDATA[116934]]></id>
    <qid><![CDATA[112062]]></qid>
    <question><![CDATA[I know how to pay for goods and services that I buy online (e.g. using direct bank transfer, credit/debit cards, other online payment systems).   ]]></question>
