    <qid><![CDATA[112106]]></qid>
    <question><![CDATA[I know 'green' behaviours to follow when buying or using digital devices (e.g. purchase devices with Eco-label, restrain from unnecessary printing of digital files, do not leave mobile phones and laptop chargers connected without the device). ]]></question>
